# The schedule for tenant "{{TENANT}}". GENERATED by `engine schedule {{TENANT}}`
# from [host.schedule] in that tenant's tenant.toml. Never hand-edit this copy:
# the next boot renders over it. Change the tenant file and restart.
#
# Read by supercronic (phase 7 row 7.21). Times are five-field cron in the
# tenant's own timezone, named below: supercronic schedules in the container's
# timezone unless the crontab carries CRON_TZ.
#
# Nothing else is exported here. Supercronic's own documentation calls crontab
# environment lines a compatibility feature and recommends setting the
# environment before it starts, which is what the entrypoint does; jobs inherit
# it. The code lives at {{REPO}} and every job's output is appended under
# {{LOG_DIR}}.
CRON_TZ={{TZ}}

{{JOBS}}
